# Selavon is free (Milestone 25d; like nordveil_victory.scene) - the last of
# the three kingdoms: the end of Act II's kingdoms. KingdomVictory's card
# follows, with the Act II title.

spawn {a1} {a1} at 15,18 facing up
spawn {a2} {a2} at 17,18 facing up
spawn {a3} {a3} at 16,19 facing up
music town
move player to 16,12 async
move {a1} to 15,13 async
move {a2} to 17,13 async
move {a3} to 16,14 async
spawn kid1 child at 5,15 facing up
spawn neighbor1 worker at 20,15 facing up
spawn neighbor2 merchant at 6,4 facing down
move kid1 to 12,12 async
move neighbor1 to 20,12 async
move neighbor2 to 13,10 async
sync
face player up
emote kid1 heart
emote neighbor1 note
say Harbormaster: The sea's gone still. After a month of that storm... I can hear gulls again.
say Harbormaster: Nordveil, Duskara, and now Selavon. Three kingdoms you've pulled back out of the dark.
emote player note
say Child: The water's all gone from our street! My shoes are dry!
emote frank note
say Frank: Look at that. Every kingdom breathing again. I've watched a lot of ages turn, friends. I've never seen four souls do it like this.
say Frank: But the Unraveling still bleeds from one place. The Blighted Maw, to the south. That's where Vorath waits.
say Frank: Not today, though. Today Selavon throws you a feast, and you are going to eat it.
say Harbormaster: Come and see me before you go. The merchants have something for you.
